{
  "_about": "HeadClamp.cs (lane E): limits the head (and, at neckShare x the limits, the neck) relative to the TORSO bone in LateUpdate after the Animator. yaw / pitch = degrees of the head's forward axis vs the torso (Spine2). knee: soft limit (nothing changes below knee x limit). Categories are matched by Animator state short name (first match wins; during a transition the limits and the on/off weight are blended by the transition time); off=true leaves the animation alone (hit reactions, death, get-up own the head). look: optional look-at toward the opponent (weight 0..1 of the angle to the target), faded to 0 when the target is between fadeStartDeg and fadeEndDeg off the body's forward. Data for a character is picked by 'name' contained in the root object name. Copy to StreamingAssets for the player (BuildPlayer does). maxUpDeg / maxUpKnee (JOANHEAD): cap on the head's absolute pitch in the root frame (degrees up from level, 90 = off; soft: unchanged below maxUpKnee x cap), the excess is taken off the neck (neckShare) and the head; faded by the category on/off weight. Fixes the Mixamo idle / walk chin-up (idle +17 deg, walk +9 deg). Harness flag -noclamp turns the clamp off to see the raw animation.",
